274Z | User: m.ward | Image:  | Cmd:  | Target: \r\nevt-00524 | Code: 4689 | TS: 2026-05-06T00:00:26.282Z | User: m.ward | Image:  | Cmd:  | Target: \r\nevt-00526 | Code: 4688 | TS: 2026-05-06T00:00:26.282Z | User: m.ward | Image:  | Cmd: \"C:\\windows\\system32\\whoami.exe\" /groups | Target: \r\nevt-00528 | Code: 4673"]
